Pharaoh  writes:

> Is it possible to build a cluster using Alpha's??

It certainly is.

> I have the following hardware:

> -2x AXPpci33 noname Mobo's with 166MHz CPU's (OC to 200 MHZ).
> -2x 40 MB 36bits memory (2 x 16 + 2 x 4).
> -2x 1GB scsi2 HD's (system disks)
> -1x pioneer scsi cdrom
> -1x 9 GB scsi HD (data disk)
