This is how I have ftpaccess set up on my RH6.0 alpha box, it lets
anonymous uploads to /home/ftp/incoming occur:

--------

class   all   real,guest,anonymous  *

email root@localhost

loginfails 5

readme  README*    login
readme  README*    cwd=*

message /welcome.msg            login
message .message                cwd=*

compress        yes     all
tar             yes     all
chmod           yes     all
delete          yes     all
overwrite       yes     all
rename          yes     all

log transfers   guest,real,anonymous    inbound,outbound

upload /home/ftp *                              no
upload /home/ftp /incoming      yes     ftp daemon 0666 nodirs

shutdown /etc/shutmsg

passwd-check rfc822 warn
#tar                    no      anonymous
#compress               no      anonymous
#chmod                  yes     real
#delete                 yes     real
#overwrite              yes     guest,real
#rename                 yes     real

-------

I think I rearranged this setup from /usr/doc/wu-ftpd/examples

Good luck,

Tony Hammitt


