CD since the architectures are very different.  Cheapbytes.com has Alpha
install CDs for about $5+$2 shipping.  Well worth the money, really.

Or you could find some friend with broadband and a CD-burner or a fast
network and install after downloading the images.  That can be approximately
zero cost using the network install.

